1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,829
Lead sudah closing.

2
00:00:01,829 --> 00:00:03,635
Tapi iklanmu tahu nggak?

3
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:08,631
Di Leads, satu klik status
mengirim hasilnya ke iklan.

4
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,405
Buka Pelacakan dan Iklan, lalu Leads.

5
00:00:13,405 --> 00:00:18,117
Empat kartu di atas: total, lead
baru, closing, dan nilai.

6
00:00:18,950 --> 00:00:20,069
Klik tab Aktif.

7
00:00:20,069 --> 00:00:25,143
Cari pakai nama atau nomor lengkap, lalu
saring Sumber dan Platform.

8
00:00:26,450 --> 00:00:28,083
Pelanggan sudah bayar?

9
00:00:28,083 --> 00:00:30,310
Klik statusnya, pilih Closing.

10
00:00:31,950 --> 00:00:34,980
Isi Jumlah Nilai, klik Konfirmasi Update.

11
00:00:36,950 --> 00:00:40,940
Closing tercatat sebagai pendapatan,
dan terkirim ke iklan!

12
00:00:43,450 --> 00:00:45,237
Mau tahu dari iklan mana?

13
00:00:45,237 --> 00:00:48,026
Buka Lihat Detail, cek Identifier Klik.

14
00:00:49,450 --> 00:00:50,715
Lead nggak muncul?

15
00:00:50,715 --> 00:00:54,440
Hapus filternya, lalu matikan
Sembunyikan Pengunjung.

16
00:00:56,050 --> 00:00:58,801
Ubah status, iklan ikut belajar.

17
00:00:58,801 --> 00:01:01,381
Panduannya di konektor dot id.
